								"icon": "outdent",
								"name": "WYSIWYG",
								"type": "wysiwyg_basic",
								"html": "<p><strong>If you would like to join our Wake County team, please email our Emergency Disaster Services coordinator <a href=\"mailto:jere.schramm@uss.salvationarmy.org\" target=\"\">Jere Schramm</a>&nbsp;(<a href=\"tel:9198346733\">919-834-6733</a> ext. 66907) or volunteer coordinator <a href=\"mailto:rosemary.weber@uss.salvationarmy.org\" target=\"\">Rosemary Weber</a>&nbsp;(<a href=\"tel:9198346733\">919-834-6733</a> ext. 66836).</strong></p>",
