												"name": "Paragraph",
												"type": "textarea",
												"html": "<p>The first step in being ready to respond to an emergency is training. In partnership with other agencies, The Salvation Army’s disaster training program offers a variety of courses designed to help individuals and communities prepare for emergency events and become trained disaster volunteers.</p>",
